      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_37326793-88aa-4587-b58b-07073df8839a\n\nWorld, which has recently emerged as a headliner, uses a combat system to handle ragdolling upon player death. (Naturally, this causes m problems, we have several players who have gone invisible! )",
